_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990530/extras/a24c74664aa1158647f4d097084c77dc.avif?t=1777023136\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br>● A variety of shipboard modules can be customized and combined to match various functions of vessels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990530/extras/75dd37994c805b756857da42ac2be289.avif?t=1777023136\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br>● Weapons of various qualities come with different random entries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990530/extras/80bc05cdcdad9af7ec793652ce8d1036.avif?t=1777023136\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br>●Customizable Character<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990530/extras/423dab7f053fa2891c6ae6a45a7a7400.avif?t=1777023136\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br>●Customizable Land Vehicles<br><br><strong>and:</strong><br>●A completely seamless and infinite open world<br>●Dynamic Day-Night Cycle and Weather System<br>●Freely Buildable Facilities in the Cabin of Ship<br>●Customizable Character Upgrade Path<br>●A Variety of Craftable Items<br>●Pirate Encounters and Naval Battles", "short_description": "You are just an ordinary person, with only a small boat serving as your home, struggling to find a way to survive in the ruthless ocean of the post-apocalyptic world.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, German, Japanese, French, Spanish - Spain, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990530/header.jpg?t=1777023136", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990530/7d0467591494b25059381df4ca5d3592314e0f31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777023136", "capsule_imagev5": "https: